MANDATORY EDUCATIONAL USE CONDITIONS:

1. Educational Use Only: This software may ONLY be used for:
   - Academic cybersecurity education and research
   - Authorized educational institutions
   - Supervised cybersecurity training programs
   - Academic research with proper institutional oversight

2. VM Isolation Required: This software MUST ONLY be deployed in:
   - Isolated virtual machines with no production network access
   - Educational laboratory environments
   - Sandboxed testing environments with proper controls
   - Academic research environments with appropriate safeguards

3. Instructor Supervision: Use of this software requires:
   - Qualified cybersecurity instructor supervision
   - Institutional approval and oversight
   - Completed student safety training
   - Documented educational objectives

4. Safety Measures: All users must:
   - Verify educational safety measures are in place
   - Use only localhost (127.0.0.1) network bindings
   - Maintain VM isolation throughout usage
   - Report any security concerns to educational authorities

PROHIBITED USES:

- Commercial use or distribution
- Production deployment of any kind
- Malicious use or actual cyber attacks
- Use without proper educational oversight
- Use outside of isolated virtual machines
- Modification for malicious purposes
- Distribution to unauthorized parties

